  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zfojiw3.png\" width=\"728\" height=\"211\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/W758n8u.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"887\" height=\"300\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><br><a href=\"https://discord.gg/sGwxnFV\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/T4ltmGW.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/Joosh7889\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ewzK3Zb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCUvb1-kBGDEA1gVtd3UhlLg/videos\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EirVdtZ.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fbonsaistudios\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AEfwGvx.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmcmodels.net%252fvendors%252f29%252fjoosh\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/pXWpwIb.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/52LU4mv.png\" width=\"86\" height=\"23\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Creeper Overhaul 以多種不同生物群系的苦力怕變體取代了原版苦力怕，其中有些比其他更為友善！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/XIf8yMA1V2U?wmode=transparent\" width=\"327\" height=\"327\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><strong>您可能也會感興趣：</strong><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/creeper-overhaul\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OMlhHaU.png\" alt=\"Creeper Overhaul 資源包\" width=\"338\" height=\"71\"></a><br>由 lord_gogomines 打造的資源包，將 Creeper Overhaul 中的苦力怕帶入原版 Minecraft！<br><strong><br></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/creeper-overhaul-overhaul\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jUxOI3S.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"371\" height=\"78\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">由 wadoo154 為 Creeper Overhaul 製作的粉絲動畫資源包</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mnnbI3S.png\" width=\"115\" height=\"23\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Josh/Joosh - 美術<br>ThatGravyBoat - 模組程式開發<br>scratchy_sd - 所有苦力怕音效<br>ArkticBoi - 概念美術<br>thesamirmc - 標誌設計<br><strong><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZtjUq8p.png\" width=\"293\" height=\"23\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/creatures-and-beasts\" rel=\"nofollow\">Creatures and Beasts</a></strong>&nbsp;- 向 Minecraft 中添加驚人生物的模組！<br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/critters-and-companions\" rel=\"nofollow\">Critters and Companions</a></strong> - 添加各種友善動物的模組！<br><strong><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ghost\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ghost</a></strong> - 為您的世界增添兩種友善的幽靈生物！<br><strong><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nightlights\" rel=\"nofollow\">Night Lights</a></strong>&nbsp;- 添加海量多樣化的裝飾性光源！<br><strong><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lookin-sharp\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lookin' Sharp</a></strong>&nbsp;- 為遊戲新增 60 種近戰武器！<br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/golem-overhaul\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Golem Overhaul</a> </strong>- 全面改造原版苦力怕的模組！&nbsp;<br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enderman-overhaul\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enderman Overhaul</a></strong> - 全面改造原版終界傳人的模組！&nbsp;<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ribbits\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Ribbits</strong></a>&nbsp;- 添加充滿名為 Ribbits 的小村民的沼澤村莊！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcloudnord.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nLUVuvA.png\" width=\"844\" height=\"275\"></a></p>",
